5,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Yay! This is going to be so exciting! I'm going to find the werewolf and be the hero! Everyone, let's be super honest, okay?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I believe observing how people react to pressure is the most reliable method. I will be watching closely.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Logic and consistency are key. I suggest we establish a baseline for everyone's speaking patterns today to make deception easier to spot later.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Mizuki. I'll be observing the flow of the conversation and noting any contradictions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,A simple approach. I'll be calculating the probabilities based on your behavior. Try not to be too predictable; it makes this boring.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Probabilities? That sounds like school! I just want to play! @Victoria, do you think you can tell if someone is lying just by looking at them?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"It is not about a single look, but a series of subtle shifts in demeanor. I will try to be objective.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"While intuition has its place, we should prioritize verified information. If anyone claims a role, we must scrutinize the timing of that claim.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,Indeed. The timing of a claim often reveals more than the claim itself. I'll be keeping a record of who speaks when.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, your focus on ""verified information"" is a bit too textbook. I'm more interested in who tries too hard to sound logical.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,I'm not trying to be a textbook! I'm just Rin! Let's all just be friends until we have to vote!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"Friendship is a pleasant sentiment, Rin, but in this game, it can be a mask. We should remain cautious.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Caution is necessary. I will be analyzing the contradictions between the claims and the actual outcomes of the nights.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,I'll be watching for those who are overly assertive in directing the group. That often hides a specific agenda.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, that's a broad net. I prefer to isolate suspects by finding the one whose logic fails under pressure.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
